I was being sloppy. The same kind of thinking by Popper and Bartley that
led to PCR (a prescription for rationality which is much richer and
broader and more complex than the Socratic method) *also* led to a school
of epistemology which seems to have acquired the rather bland label
"evolutionary epistemology". At least the big collection of pro-PCR
essasys on epistemology that I saw the other day, edited by Radnitzsky,
Bartley, Popper, and someone else, was titled EVOLUTIONARY EPISTEMOLOGY.
